s_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","review_id":"qAit6XchZYCDPo3kty6DBA","date":"2019-10-28T16:11:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9472732543945312,"text_excerpt":"I love this venue/concert hall/event space! I knew this place was always situated within the casino but I had no clue just how spacious and welcoming The Fillmore was. There are two points of entry for the show which for those of us who have been 21+ for quite some time will come in handy for one of their larger shows. Go through the casino and enter through The Masquerade Bar. It is so much easier to get in through that route and more seamless I feel like. You can expect plenty of amenities including a full bar, a coat check room, snacks and actual bites, plenty of lounge seating to hang out in before the show, and super nice bathrooms. No need to worry about restrooms from your worst ni..."},{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","review_id":"Y186VopZ5UFbICuEulCbig","date":"2019-09-30T02:00:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292036294937134,"text_excerpt":"I really like this venue. I've been here twice. There's standing room in the front and seats in the back. One show was way more packed than the other. It still felt nice and cool (temperature wise) which is important when you're surrounded by hot, sweaty bodies packed together. There's more than one bar and few seating areas. It just feels roomy and has a good vibe. I hope to have more good times here!"},{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","review_id":"cpENOymaJGV5KGhnpyWPCQ","date":"2020-02-15T16:30:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.922622561454773,"text_excerpt":"This has become one of my favorite music venues. Huge space, but surprisingly, feels intimate. And on both occasions I've visited, I've been able to get very close to the stage without feeling packed in. Beautiful decor, tons of bars spread across the space so you rarely have to wait for a drink, HUGE bathroom so you never have to wait in line, and the food is outstanding (debris fries and Parmesan-crusted grilled cheese are my favorites)."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","photo_id":"kYajY20-YE5IZgh1XAQ1Fw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/kYajY20-YE5IZgh1XAQ1Fw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8825827836990356},{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","photo_id":"mHyIhbjt-tl0c9gPTK4CCQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mHyIhbjt-tl0c9gPTK4CCQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7787400484085083},{"business_id":"9eK2AZIHk8PGoVCwbwjorA","photo_id":"NIrUpkm_Upb3O9rlLaj76Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NIrUpkm_Upb3O9rlLaj76Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7751333713531494}]},"notebook_case":null}
